  "body_text": "基本信息\n国家：巴拿马 Panama\n产区：波奎特 Boquete, Chiriqui\n庄园/处理厂：驴子庄园 El Burro\n主人：Lamastus Family\n品种：卡杜艾 Catuai\n海拔：1700 - 1800 米\n庄园面积：50 公顷 Has\n咖啡种植面积：20 公顷 Has\n处理方式：非洲棚架日晒 Natural, African bed Dried\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：花香、绿葡萄、橙子、绿茶感\nFloral, Green grape, Orange, Green tea-like\n关于El Burro与本批次\nElida旗下分別有艾力达庄园(Elida Estate)、驴子庄园(El Burro Estate)以及路易多庄园(Luito Gesha Estate)，目前由第三以及第四代庄园主Wilford Lamastus和Wilford Lamastus Jr.所经营。本批次来自于驴子庄园，\n采用了非洲式棚架晒床的方式自然晾晒，也是驴子很经典的一款传统日晒处理的产品。\n关于 卡杜艾 Catuai 品种以及相关\nCatuai\n卡杜艾（读其实应该读\nka du a yi\n）\n卡杜艾Catuai品种是红色卡杜拉Caturra（代号IAC 476-11）\n与\n新世界Mundo Novo (代号374-19）于1949年在巴西圣保罗的科研中心IAC，人工将其杂交选育出来的，1972年开始在巴西商业种植推广，按照批次代号不同，熟果颜色\n也有所差异。\nCaturra\n卡杜拉\n波旁品种的自然变异品种，据记录最早于1915-1918年之间在巴西的米纳斯吉拉斯州发现，卡杜拉的树型很矮小、紧凑，单位面积里可以允许栽种更多的植株，而且它还很高产，1937年左右，巴西圣保罗的咖啡研究中心开始对卡杜拉进行大规模的选育测试，虽然巴西从没有官方正式的发行过卡杜拉，但由于它矮小（便于采摘），紧凑高产（栽种更多产量跟可观），所以再中美洲特别的流行，卡杜拉的杯品继承了波旁的特征，甜感饱满，酸质很柔和，有柑橘到莓果的符合调性，它唯独的弱点是对叶锈病的抵抗较差，所以一些产区用它来一些对叶锈病抗性较为突出的品种做杂交选育。\n卡杜拉成熟后有\n红果和黄果两种，据说黄卡杜拉的成熟期比红卡杜拉要早一些。\nMundo Novo\n新世界\n它是一个自然环境下发生的杂交品种，来源于印尼移植到巴西的铁皮卡品种与巴西本土的波旁品种。\n众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SpgcKv7UYBh3qr9oUBvkgmvbdrfMSib429Soiaiaw9ep4CO2GsUPAtjes7VPR2BubxibRyyP7lEniaZHw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<br/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           基本信息\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          国家：巴拿马 Panama\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          产区：波奎特 Boquete, Chiriqui\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园/处理厂：驴子庄园 El Burro\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          主人：Lamastus Family\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：卡杜艾 Catuai\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔：1700 - 1800 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园面积：50 公顷 Has\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          咖啡种植面积：20 公顷 Has\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：非洲棚架日晒 Natural, African bed Dried\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：花香、绿葡萄、橙子、绿茶感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Green grape, Orange, Green tea-like\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Sp7lWesudZDJpEbxUWBribqCncaEk99vEmzeTvDLuCU0JvLglHEILS8ibBwGPfdSSib5TIL6E0m0MZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 799px;text-align: left;white-space: normal;width: 578px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于El Burro与本批次\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n           Elida旗下分別有艾力达庄园(Elida Estate)、驴子庄园(El Burro Estate)以及路易多庄园(Luito Gesha Estate)，目前由第三以及第四代庄园主Wilford Lamastus和Wilford Lamastus Jr.所经营。本批次来自于驴子庄园，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"text-align: left;\">\n           采用了非洲式棚架晒床的方式自然晾晒，也是驴子很经典的一款传统日晒处理的产品。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ROeO0aNVxkf3Msul3mHibV7n4viaicH2a9Wq0k3aia4qaHq2mYwHDIibJPAFxrhYOymuLE639g0sc8ZWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: left;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: left;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: left;\">\n           关于 卡杜艾 Catuai 品种以及相关\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: left;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">\n             Catuai\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n             卡杜艾（读其实应该读\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">\n             ka du a yi\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n             ）\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;'>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";'>\n           卡杜艾Catuai品种是红色卡杜拉Caturra（代号IAC 476-11）\n          </span>\n          与\n          <span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";'>\n           新世界Mundo Novo (代号374-19）于1949年在巴西圣保罗的科研中心IAC，人工将其杂交选育出来的，1972年开始在巴西商业种植推广，按照批次代号不同，熟果颜色\n          </span>\n          也有所差异。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7ROeO0aNVxkf3Msul3mHibV7ia1r94zpUah741gwrMFNWBA70iaYJQhtKWc2APRtA4CPcTRibJwgUellg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-size: 14px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">\n             Caturra\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n             卡杜拉\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          波旁品种的自然变异品种，据记录最早于1915-1918年之间在巴西的米纳斯吉拉斯州发现，卡杜拉的树型很矮小、紧凑，单位面积里可以允许栽种更多的植株，而且它还很高产，1937年左右，巴西圣保罗的咖啡研究中心开始对卡杜拉进行大规模的选育测试，虽然巴西从没有官方正式的发行过卡杜拉，但由于它矮小（便于采摘），紧凑高产（栽种更多产量跟可观），所以再中美洲特别的流行，卡杜拉的杯品继承了波旁的特征，甜感饱满，酸质很柔和，有柑橘到莓果的符合调性，它唯独的弱点是对叶锈病的抵抗较差，所以一些产区用它来一些对叶锈病抗性较为突出的品种做杂交选育。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          卡杜拉成熟后有\n         </span>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-size: 14px;'>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           红果和黄果两种，据说黄卡杜拉的成熟期比红卡杜拉要早一些。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">\n             Mundo Novo\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n             新世界\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-size: 14px;'>\n          它是一个自然环境下发生的杂交品种，来源于印尼移植到巴西的铁皮卡品种与巴西本土的波旁品种。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc